utton></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-5 xl:flex-col xl:items-start xl:gap-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 md:gap-2.5 mb-3 md:mb-0 xl:mb-3 flex-shrink-0 xl:gap-1.5"><span class="contents"><div class="relative w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 xl:w-10 xl:h-10 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color:rgba(240,208,96,0.08);border:1.5px solid rgba(240,208,96,0.40);box-shadow:0 0 12px #F0D06025, inset 0 0 0 1px #F0D06030"><img alt="Step 1" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_5a67db8e144ebcad419b61a347d0cfd2.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_5a67db8e144ebcad419b61a347d0cfd2.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_5a67db8e144ebcad419b61a347d0cfd2.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></span><span class="contents"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-4 md:w-5 xl:w-3.5 text-base font-heading font-bold leading-none select-none" style="color:#F0D060;text-shadow:0 0 6px #F0D06080" aria-hidden="true">➔</span><div class="relative w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 xl:w-10 xl:h-10 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color:rgba(240,208,96,0.08);border:1.5px solid rgba(240,208,96,0.40);box-shadow:0 0 12px #F0D06025, inset 0 0 0 1px #F0D06030"><img alt="Step 2" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A