:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Use when enemy sustain or attack-speed carries matter more than out-of-combat reset speed.</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/athenas-shield">Athena&#x27;s Shield</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right relative top-[1px] h-3 w-3 text-text-accent/65" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="text-mlbb-text-secondary/65">over</span><a class="font-semibold text-text-accent transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/radiant-armor">Radiant Armor</a></span><span class="basis-full text-[12.5px] text-mlbb-text-secondary/90 sm:basis-auto sm:before:mx-1 sm:before:text-mlbb-text-secondary/50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Use when the magic threat is a one-combo burst mage instead of repeated tick damage.</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/antique-cuirass">Antique Cuirass</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right relative top-[1px] h-3 w-3 text-text-accent/65" aria-hidden="true