anus.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/uranus#build-anti-physical-frontline\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Anti-Physical Frontline build for Uranus.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/uranus#build-anti-physical-frontline\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/uranus\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T909,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Uranus in Mobile Legends: Regen Tempo Support\",\"description\":\"Use this greedier sustain route when Support Emblem's healing and cooldown stats are worth buying Enchanted Talisman for mana stability.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Guardian Helmet\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Support Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Revitalize Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the Regen Tempo Support build for Uranus.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/uranus#build-regen-tempo-support\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Enchanted Talisman\",\"text\":\"Purchase Enchanted Talisman (2,070 gold) as item 2 in the Regen Tempo Support build for Uranus.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/uranus#build-regen-tempo-support\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Oracle\",\"text\":\"Purchase Oracle (1,860 gold) as item 3 in the Regen Tempo Support build for Uranus.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/uranus#build-regen-tempo-support\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Radiant Armor\",\"text\":\"Purchase Radiant Armor (1,880 gold) as item 4 in the Regen Tempo Support build for Uranus.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/uranus#build-regen-tempo-support\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Guardian Helmet\",\"text\":\"Purchase Guardian Helmet (2,500 gold) as item 5 in the Regen Tempo Support build for Uranus.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/uranus#build-regen-tempo-support\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Regen Tempo Support build for Uranus.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/uranus#build-regen-tempo-support\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/uranus\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}60:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":59,\"name\":\"Uranus\",\"slug\":\"uranus\",\"title\":\"Aesthereal Defender\",\"role\":[\"Tank\"],\"specialty\":[\"Regen\"],\"lane\":[\"EXP\"],\"tier\":\"C\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2018,\"stats\":{\"durability\":100,\"offense\":20,\"controlEffect\":20,\"difficulty\":20},\"winRate\":49.28,\"pickRate\":0.35,\"banRate\":0.35,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Uranus has great sustainability, making him strong against heroes with low-damage abilities, such as Tigreal and Franco.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"franco\",\"heroName\":\"Franco\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Uranus has great sustainability, making him strong against heroes with low-damage abilities, such as Tigreal and Franco.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Uranus lacks Mobility and CC abilities which makes him an easy target for ranged heroes, such as Layla and Lesley.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"lesley\",\"heroName\":\"Lesley\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Uranus lacks Mobility and CC abilities which makes him an easy target for ranged heroes, such as Layla and Lesley.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_1e52a042e596bd333ccab46d00bb8c72.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2e15a0a506aaecd9b3de40a8cc9f7ec7.png\",\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Radiance\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Each time Uranus takes damage, he gains a stack of Radiance. Each stack recovers 1.2-11.2 HP (increases with level) every 0.8s for 10s, up to 20 stacks.\\nUranus's Basic Attacks deal (+80% Total Physical Attack) (+ 4-8 × Radiance stacks) Magic Damage (increases with level).\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Each time Uranus takes damage, he gains a stack of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Radiance\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Each stack recovers 1.2-11.2 HP (increases with level) every 0.8s for 10s, up to 20 stacks.\\nUranus's Basic Attacks deal \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+80% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(+ 4-8 × Radiance stacks)\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage (increases with level).\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_90324508ebba14fda61e55dfcf44b366.png\",\"tags\":[\"Heal\"]},{\"name\":\"Ionic Edge\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Uranus releases 2 energy blades that orbit around him, dealing 155 (+30% Total Magic Power) (+6 × Radiance stacks) Magic Damage to enemies hit and slowing them by 30% for 2s.\\nEach blade can only damage the same target once.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Uranus releases 2 energy blades that orbit around him, dealing 155\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+30% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(+6 × Radiance stacks)\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies hit and slowing them by 30% for 2s.\\nEach blade can only damage the same target once.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"4s\",\"manaCost\":\"60\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e6a35f29615510ea57f24f4bb68273ac.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"Slow\"]},{\"name\":\"Transcendent Ward\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Uranus charges to the target location, dealing 80 (+20% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies along the way, and 160 (+80% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies at the target location and slowing them by 25%. Uranus also generates a 300 (+200% Total Magic Power) shield for 4s.\\n\\nThe shield explodes at the end of its duration or when destroyed, dealing 300 (+150% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies nearby.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Uranus charges to the target location, dealing 80\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+20% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies along the way, and 160\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+80% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies at the target location and slowing them by 25%. Uranus also generates a 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+200% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" shield for 4s.\\n\\nThe shield explodes at the end of its duration or when destroyed, dealing 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+150% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies nearby.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"10s\",\"manaCost\":\"80\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5a67db8e144ebcad419b61a347d0cfd2.png\",\"tags\":[\"Mobility\",\"Shield\"]},{\"name\":\"Consecration\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Uranus unleashes the energy stored within his body, removing slow effects on himself, recovering 200 HP, and gaining 60% Movement Speed for 8s (decays over time).\\n\\nUranus directly gains 5 stacks of Radiance, increasing shields received and HP Regen by 20% for 8s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Uranus unleashes the energy stored within his body, removing slow effects on himself, recovering 200 HP, and gaining 60% Movement Speed for 8s (decays over time).\\n\\nUranus directly gains 5 stacks of Radiance, increasing shields received and HP Regen by 20% for 8s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"42s\",\"manaCost\":\"100\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1f92cbcc716af295b0e8702936fb19b7.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\",\"Speed Up\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Level 1 learn S2 then max S2 level up ultimate when availabl\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Level 1 learn S2 then max S2 level up ultimate when availabl\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"beatrix\",\"heroName\":\"Beatrix\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Uranus becomes much more powerful when working with high-damage heroes like Beatrix and Hanabi.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"hanabi\",\"heroName\":\"Hanabi\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Uranus becomes much more powerful when working with high-damage heroes like Beatrix and Hanabi.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Uranus should use his 2nd Skill to enter the fight, then his Ultimate to survive under enemy attacks while spamming his 1st Skill for sustained damage.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":5920,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5a67db8e144ebcad419b61a347d0cfd2.png\"},{\"skillId\":5930,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1f92cbcc716af295b0e8702936fb19b7.png\"},{\"skillId\":5910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e6a35f29615510ea57f24f4bb68273ac.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Uranus can use his 1st Skill to poke the enemy, then use the 2nd Skill - 1st Skill combo when their HP is low to finish them off.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":5910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e6a35f29615510ea57f24f4bb68273ac.png\"},{\"skillId\":5920,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5a67db8e144ebcad419b61a347d0cfd2.png\"},{\"skillId\":5910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e6a35f29615510ea57f24f4bb68273ac.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Uranus build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. Learn cut-lane tempo, Oracle spikes, real side-lane pressure, and when EXP Uranus is a trap.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Uranus is not an engage tank. He is a lane thief who turns wave tempo into map pressure, then dares the enemy team to waste real cooldowns chasing a target they still cannot finish. Pick him when your draft wants an EXP sponge that can cut, scout, and stall, not when it needs reliable lockdown.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"uranus\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"exp-sustain-cut\",\"name\":\"EXP Sustain Cut\",\"roleContext\":\"EXP\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"thunder-belt\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\",\"cost\":1820,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"guardian-helmet\",\"name\":\"Guardian Helmet\",\"cost\":2500,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},{\"slug\":\"thunder-belt\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"common\",\"name\":\"Basic Common Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"agility\",\"name\":\"Agility\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/agility.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"tenacity\",\"name\":\"Tenacity\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/tenacity.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"brave-smite\",\"name\":\"Brave Smite\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/brave-smite.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"revitalize\",\"name\":\"Revitalize\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the lane opponent and first gank threat are both physical damage dealers.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"guardian-helmet\",\"name\":\"Guardian Helmet\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when Chang'e, Valir, Yve, or other repeated magic damage keeps tagging you before Radiance stacks stabilize.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against burst mages who can remove most of your HP before Oracle and Revitalize start paying back.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default ranked Uranus build for cutting waves, holding Radiance stacks, and turning Oracle plus Revitalize into repeat side-lane pressure.\",\"totalCost\":11010,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":4250,\"sources\":[\"Oracle\",\"Thunder Belt\",\"Guardian Helmet\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"hpregen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hpRegen\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":20,\"sources\":[\"Guardian Helmet\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":90,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\",\"Oracle\",\"Thunder Belt\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":93,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Dominance Ice\",\"Oracle\",\"Thunder Belt\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":60,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Thunder Belt\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Oracle\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=uranus\u0026items=tough-boots%2Cdominance-ice%2Coracle%2Cthunder-belt%2Cguardian-helmet%2Cimmortality\u0026spell=revitalize\u0026emblem=common\u0026talents=agility%2Ctenacity%2Cbrave-smite\u0026flex=warrior-boots.tough-boots%2Cradiant-armor.guardian-helmet%2Cathenas-shield.immortality\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"anti-physical-frontline\",\"name\":\"Anti-Phy