ems nullify incoming damage. He has watched civilizations rise and fall from his cosmic perch, intervening only when the balance tips too far. The Abyss's encroachment finally forced him to descend and fight directly among mortals.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"hylos\",\"heroName\":\"Hylos\",\"relationship\":\"Nature guardian who fights alongside him\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"grock\",\"heroName\":\"Grock\",\"relationship\":\"Fellow ancient guardian protecting the realm\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"jawhead\",\"heroName\":\"Jawhead\",\"relationship\":\"Corrupted robot whose systems conflict with his\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"x-borg\",\"heroName\":\"X.Borg\",\"relationship\":\"Fire maniac whose flames challenge his regeneration\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"$undefined\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":50.61,\"pickRate\":0.42,\"banRate\":0.66},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":50.41,\"pickRate\":0.43,\"banRate\":0.66},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":50.72,\"pickRate\":0.4,\"banRate\":0.53},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":49.49,\"pickRate\":0.36,\"banRate\":0.34},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":49.46,\"pickRate\":0.35,\"banRate\":0.34},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":49.2,\"pickRate\":0.34,\"banRate\":0.34},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":49.28,\"pickRate\":0.35,\"banRate\":0.35}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n62:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Uranus\",\"heroSlug\":\"uranus\",\"roles\":\"$61:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$61:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty\":1,\"winRate\":49.28,\"pickRate\":0.35,\"banRate\":0.35,\"curatedBuilds\":\"$61:props:curatedBuilds\",\"topCounters\":\"$61:props:tabData:counterData:countersThisHero\",\"hasCounterPage\":true,\"hasRankStats\":true,\"locale\":\"en\",\"pageUrl\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/uranus\",\"year\":2026}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"6a:I[313915,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default